	SAY NAME1 "Full Plate Mail"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Full plate armor is the best armor a warrior can buy, both in appearance and protection. The perfectly fitted, interlocking plates are specially angled to deflect arrows and blows, and the entire suit is carefully adorned with rich engraving and embossed detail.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 1 (-2 vs. slashing, -1 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -3
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 70"

	SAY NAME2 "Plate of the Dark +3"
	SAY DESC "Dark Lord Hertious, undead Warlord of Bane, wore this piece of armor for over five hundred years. During this time he was rumored to dwell in a castle somewhere within the Earthfast Mountains. How his armor moved to other lands without him is not certain, though the separation of the two was surely unpleasant.

STATISTICS:

Equipped Abilities:
- Protection from Good
- 20% chance to drain one level from attackers (save vs. Death at -4 negates)

Armor Class: -2 (-5 vs. slashing, -4 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -3
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 35
"





